    "detailed_description": "This is a third-person game where the player controls a character to press switches, open doors, and interact with objects to complete a single stage.<br />\r\nDeveloped with Unreal Engine 5, the game features a coastal environment with cliffs and terrain variation.<br />\r\nAs the player walks along sandy beaches or the shoreline, dynamic footprints are left behind and waves react accordingly, enhancing the sense of presence.<br />\r\nThere is no background music\u2014only carefully placed environmental sound effects to support immersion.<br />\r\nThe character is controlled using the WASD keys.",
